  "description": {
    "text": "The second Pokémon Card Display Set Gift Box (宝可梦卡牌展示套礼盒) came out on 18 June 2024 with Brave Stars. Each box held one random special-art holo card, one of 13, with a silicone display case for that card's Pokémon and a random 25-card Brave Stars pack. Twelve cards, numbered out of 12, each show a Pokémon with a trainer: Charizard, Flaaffy, Zekrom, Dedenne, Alcremie, Wyrdeer, Kleavor, Ariados, Spiritomb, Galarian Obstagoon, Druddigon and Hoothoot. With luck a box held the hidden thirteenth card, a Pikachu numbered 013, and a Pikachu display case.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: New products with Brave Stars: the Irida & Adaman boxes, display set gift box vol. 2 and more (24 May 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15824.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSMC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 012",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: New products with Brave Stars: the Irida & Adaman boxes, display set gift box vol. 2 and more (24 May 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15824.html"
      }
    ]
  },
